{
  "version": 1,
  "source_hash": 359118269438736417,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "More properties of the discriminant",
      "source_hash": 5621716284750934819,
      "context_hash": 11698011342305887569,
      "translation": "판별식의 추가 성질",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-23T12:01:18.599181Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "I'll remind you that the discriminant of a number field $K$ is given by",
      "source_hash": 7826776997738306208,
      "context_hash": 16508341434536172650,
      "translation": "수체 $K$의 판별식은 다음과 같이 주어짐을 상기시켜 드립니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-23T12:01:18.599185Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "where $\\alpha_1$, \\dots, $\\alpha_n$ is a $\\ZZ$-basis for $K$, and the $\\sigma_i$ are the $n$ embeddings of $K$ into $\\CC$.",
      "source_hash": 126877319326047927,
      "context_hash": 5741263283891978097,
      "translation": "여기서 $\\alpha_1$, \\dots, $\\alpha_n$은 $K$의 $\\ZZ$-기저이며, $\\sigma_i$는 $K$에서 $\\CC$로의 $n$개의 매장입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-23T12:01:18.599185Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Several examples, properties, and equivalent definitions follow.",
      "source_hash": 15278552049319140437,
      "context_hash": 5036778666346458592,
      "translation": "몇 가지 예시, 성질, 그리고 동치인 정의들이 이어집니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-23T12:01:18.599186Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Discriminant of cyclotomic field",
      "source_hash": 6272500613027848218,
      "context_hash": 15894900321375008929,
      "translation": "원분체의 판별식",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-23T12:01:18.599186Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Let $p$ be an odd rational prime and $\\zeta_p$ a primitive $p$th root of unity. Let $K = \\QQ(\\zeta_p)$. Show that \\[ \\Delta_K = (-1)^{\\frac{p-1}{2}} p^{p-2}. \\]",
      "source_hash": 7496376171866314196,
      "context_hash": 5680570213038971767,
      "translation": "$p$를 홀수 유리 소수라 하고 $\\zeta_p$를 1의 원시 $p$제곱근이라 합시다. $K = \\QQ(\\zeta_p)$라 합시다. 다음을 보이십시오. \\[ \\Delta_K = (-1)^{\\frac{p-1}{2}} p^{p-2}. \\]",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-23T12:01:18.599186Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Direct linear algebra computation.",
      "source_hash": 16943093696975881664,
      "context_hash": 13043471766809728151,
      "translation": "직접적인 선형대수 계산입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-23T12:01:18.599186Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Trace representation of $\\Delta_K$",
      "source_hash": 898063886515929009,
      "context_hash": 15250439696018595531,
      "translation": "$\\Delta_K$의 대각합 표현",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "representation": "표현"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-08-23T12:01:18.599187Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "Let $\\alpha_1$, \\dots, $\\alpha_n$ be a basis for $\\OO_K$. Prove that",
      "source_hash": 1908138525231262716,
      "context_hash": 13804481228528544743,
      "translation": "$\\alpha_1$, \\dots, $\\alpha_n$을 $\\OO_K$의 기저라 합시다. 다음을 증명하십시오",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-23T12:01:18.599188Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "In particular, $\\Delta_K$ is an integer.",
      "source_hash": 13784451693517313672,
      "context_hash": 13483724522077427214,
      "translation": "특히, $\\Delta_K$는 정수입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-23T12:01:18.599188Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "Let $M$ be the ``embedding'' matrix. Look at $M^\\top M$, where $M^\\top$ is the transpose matrix.",
      "source_hash": 17981117221799684025,
      "context_hash": 9629092924673680691,
      "translation": "$M$을 \"매장\" 행렬이라 합시다. $M^\\top M$을 살펴보십시오. 여기서 $M^\\top$은 전치 행렬입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-23T12:01:18.599188Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "Root representation of $\\Delta_K$",
      "source_hash": 3239247087190220299,
      "context_hash": 12009679328443285471,
      "translation": "$\\Delta_K$의 근 표현",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "representation": "표현"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-08-23T12:01:18.599188Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:8/seg:0",
      "source": "The \\vocab{discriminant} of a quadratic polynomial $Ax^2+Bx+C$ is defined as $B^2-4AC$. More generally, the polynomial discriminant of a polynomial $f \\in \\ZZ[x]$ of degree $n$ is",
      "source_hash": 1532062516659609678,
      "context_hash": 937766896070462174,
      "translation": "이차 다항식 $Ax^2+Bx+C$의 \\vocab{판별식}은 $B^2-4AC$로 정의됩니다. 더 일반적으로, 차수가 $n$인 다항식 $f \\in \\ZZ[x]$의 다항식 판별식은",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-23T11:53:59.992163Z",
      "issues": [
        "LaTeX structure changed: preserve every command, brace, bracket, comment placeholder, and complete math span exactly. Source tokens: [\"command:\\\\vocab\", \"syntax:{\", \"syntax:}\", \"math:$Ax^2+Bx+C$\", \"math:$B^2-4AC$\", \"math:$f \\\\in \\\\ZZ[x]$\", \"math:$n$\"]; translation tokens: [\"math:$Ax^2+Bx+C$\", \"command:\\\\vocab\", \"syntax:{\", \"syntax:}\", \"math:$B^2-4AC$\", \"math:$n$\", \"math:$f \\\\in \\\\ZZ[x]$\"]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:9/seg:0",
      "source": "where $z_1, \\dots, z_n$ are the roots of $f$, and $c$ is the leading coefficient of $f$.",
      "source_hash": 13488601495942748014,
      "context_hash": 4688556806327818320,
      "translation": "여기서 $z_1, \\dots, z_n$은 $f$의 근이고, $c$는 $f$의 최고차항 계수입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-23T11:53:59.992172Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:10/seg:0",
      "source": "Suppose $K$ is monogenic with $\\OO_K = \\ZZ[\\theta]$. Let $f$ denote the minimal polynomial of $\\theta$ (hence monic). Show that \\[ \\Delta_K = \\Delta(f). \\]",
      "source_hash": 14050208599474526252,
      "context_hash": 11723454602453058040,
      "translation": "$K$가 모노제닉이고 $\\OO_K = \\ZZ[\\theta]$라고 합시다. $f$를 $\\theta$의 최소다항식이라고 합시다(따라서 모닉입니다). 다음을 보이십시오. \\[ \\Delta_K = \\Delta(f). \\]",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-23T11:53:59.992172Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:11/seg:0",
      "source": "Vandermonde matrices.",
      "source_hash": 2649784885590060717,
      "context_hash": 2301675829080077166,
      "translation": "반데르몬드 행렬.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-23T11:53:59.992173Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:12/seg:0",
      "source": "Show that if $K \\neq \\QQ$ is a number field then $\\left\\lvert \\Delta_K \\right\\rvert > 1$.",
      "source_hash": 366703519498728419,
      "context_hash": 10790955537134493518,
      "translation": "$K \\neq \\QQ$가 수체이면 $\\left\\lvert \\Delta_K \\right\\rvert > 1$임을 보이십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-23T11:53:59.992173Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:13/seg:0",
      "source": "$M_K \\ge 1$ must hold. Bash.",
      "source_hash": 14936873425356713811,
      "context_hash": 8663569211825494256,
      "translation": "$M_K \\ge 1$이 성립해야 합니다. 직접 계산하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-23T11:53:59.992174Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:14/seg:0",
      "source": "[Brill's theorem] For a number field $K$ with signature $(r_1, r_2)$, show that $\\Delta_K > 0$ if and only if $r_2$ is even.",
      "source_hash": 15329760197845230604,
      "context_hash": 18389479670207557352,
      "translation": "[Brill의 정리] 서명이 $(r_1, r_2)$인 수체 $K$에 대해, $\\Delta_K > 0$인 것과 $r_2$가 짝수인 것이 동치임을 보이십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-23T12:59:27.682410Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:15/seg:0",
      "source": "[Stickelberger theorem]",
      "source_hash": 3634032659945774530,
      "context_hash": 11291802035426021386,
      "translation": "[Stickelberger 정리]",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-23T12:59:27.682413Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:16/seg:0",
      "source": "Let $K$ be a number field. Prove that \\[ \\Delta_K \\equiv 0 \\text{ or } 1 \\pmod 4. \\]",
      "source_hash": 8411648866910955639,
      "context_hash": 11617833216769933151,
      "translation": "$K$를 수체라 하자. \\[ \\Delta_K \\equiv 0 \\text{ 또는 } 1 \\pmod 4 \\]임을 증명하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-23T12:59:27.682413Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "discriminant",
      "source_hash": 12376187308005531198,
      "context_hash": 786690672062559076,
      "translation": "판별식",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-23T12:59:27.682413Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "or",
      "source_hash": 9137788149709652217,
      "context_hash": 9228621948689965584,
      "translation": "또는",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-23T12:59:27.682414Z",
      "issues": []
    }
  ]
}